---
---

<section id="metrics" class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
  <div class="glass-panel-glow rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 border border-indigo-500/25 relative overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Background Gradient Circles -->
    <div class="absolute -right-20 -bottom-20 w-80 h-80 bg-indigo-600/10 blur-[90px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
      <!-- Left Copy -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-indigo-400 mb-2 block">Measurable Impact</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mb-4 leading-tight">
          導入初月から実感できる、<br class="hidden sm:block" />
          <span class="text-gradient">圧倒的なROI</span>と業務圧縮効果
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
          属人化していた複雑なバックオフィス業務・カスタマーサポート・データ集計をAIエージェントが代行することで、チームは本来注力すべきコアビジネスに集中できます。
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="flex -space-x-2 overflow-hidden">
            <div class="inline-block h-8 w-8 rounded-full ring-2 ring-slate-900 bg-indigo-500 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold text-white">S</div>
            <div class="inline-block h-8 w-8 rounded-full ring-2 ring-slate-900 bg-sky-500 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold text-white">K</div>
            <div class="inline-block h-8 w-8 rounded-full ring-2 ring-slate-900 bg-purple-500 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold text-white">T</div>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-300 font-medium">98% の利用企業が継続利用を希望</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right 4 Metrics Cards -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:gap-6">
        <div class="glass-panel p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800">
          <div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-indigo-400 mb-1 font-mono">120<span class="text-lg font-sans font-normal text-slate-300">h/月</span></div>
          <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-1">工数削減効果</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">担当者1人あたり月間平均の単純作業削減量</div>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-panel p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800">
          <div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-sky-400 mb-1 font-mono">8.5<span class="text-lg font-sans font-normal text-slate-300">x</span></div>
          <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-1">業務処理速度</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">リード対応から社内承認までの平均リードタイム</div>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-panel p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800">
          <div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-purple-400 mb-1 font-mono">最短 1<span class="text-lg font-sans font-normal text-slate-300">日</span></div>
          <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-1">即時ローンチ</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">事前開発不要、テンプレートで即日稼働開始</div>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-panel p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800">
          <div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-emerald-400 mb-1 font-mono">99.4<span class="text-lg font-sans font-normal text-slate-300">%</span></div>
          <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-1">タスク完了成功率</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">多段階エージェント自己修復メカニズム搭載</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
